@page "/rules"
@layout MainLayout
<div class="page-wrapper">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="top-line">
            <img src="images/durnius.png" alt="Žaidimo nuotrauka" class="top-image" />
        </div>

        <NavLink class="btn" href="/start">Exit</NavLink>

        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Help Page</strong></h2>
            
                <p>
                    Welcome to online game <strong>Durnius</strong>!  
                    Here you will find everything you need to know about navigating the website, creating or joining games, and learning the rules of Durak.
                </p>
            
        </div>

        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Getting Started</strong></h2>
            
            <ul>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠"><strong>Register</strong>: Create a new account with your email and password.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥"><strong>Sign In</strong>: Log in with your existing account.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Once signed in, you will see your <strong>Profile</strong>, where you can check:</p>

            <ul>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣"><strong>Points</strong>: Earned from games you play and win.</li>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦"><strong>Level</strong>: Your progression in the game.</li>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠"><strong>Settings</strong>: Adjust preferences like sound, notifications, and account info.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥"><strong>Leaderboards</strong>: See how you rank against other players.</li>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣"><strong>Friends List</strong>: Add and manage friends to play with.</li>
            </ul>

        </div>

        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Starting a Game</strong></h2>

            <p>To start your own game, click <strong>Start Game</strong>. You can choose from the following modes:</p>
            
            <ul>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦"><strong>1 vs 1</strong>: Play against another player.</li>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠"><strong>1 vs Bot</strong>: Play against the computer.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥"><strong>1 vs Multiplayer</strong>: Host a game with multiple human players.</li>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣"><strong>1 vs Multi Bots</strong>: Play against several computer opponents.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>If you choose to start a multiplayer game:</p>

            <ul> 
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦">You will be given a <strong>Game Code</strong>.</li> 
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠">Share this code with friends so they can join from the <strong>Join Game</strong> page.</li> 
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥">You will see how many players have joined in real time.</li> 
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣">Once everyone is ready, click <strong>Start Game</strong> to begin.</li> 
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Joining a Game</strong></h2>
            <ul>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦">Go to the <strong>Join Game</strong> page.</li>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠">Enter the <strong>Game Code</strong> your friend shared with you.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥">Wait until the host starts the game.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>


        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Game Rules</strong></h2>

            <h3>Basics</h3>

            <ul>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣">A standard 52-card deck is used (2 through Ace).</li>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦">The <strong>trump suit</strong> is chosen at the start of the game by revealing one card from the deck.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Attacking &amp; Defending</h3>
            <ul>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠">The <strong>attacker</strong> plays one or more cards of the same rank.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥">The <strong>defender</strong> must beat each card using a higher card of the same suit or any trump card. </li>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣">If the defender cannot beat all cards, they must <strong>pick up</strong> the played cards.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Passing</h3>
            <ul>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦">If the defender beats the cards, the turn may continue: other players (or the attacker) can add more cards of the same rank as already played cards. The defender must beat them too.</li>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠">When the defender succeeds in beating all cards, the discarded cards are removed from the game.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Objective</h3>
            <ul>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥">Players draw cards from the deck until it is empty.</li>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣">The game continues until one player is left holding cards.</li>
                <li class="diamond" data-suit="♦">That player is the <strong>Durak</strong> ("the fool").</li>
            </ul>

        </div>

        <div class="rules-square">
            <h2><strong>Tips for New Players</strong></h2>
            <ul>
                <li class="spade" data-suit="♠">Watch your trump cards carefully as they are your strongest defense.</li>
                <li class="heart" data-suit="♥">Do not waste high cards too early unless necessary.</li>
                <li class="club" data-suit="♣">Use the friend system to play with people you know.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
.page-wrapper {
    background-color: #2c425a;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 5px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

.container {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    width: 98%;
    max-width: 1300px;
    min-height: 500px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
}
.top-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;  
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    position: relative;
}

.top-image {
    width: 230px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
}

.btn {
    background-color: #2c425a;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 3px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-align: center;
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 5%;
    min-width: 120px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}

.btn:hover {
    background-color: #56708c;
    color: #f0e1b4;
}
.rules-square {
    width: 80%;
    min-height: 200px;
    background-color: rgba(26,39,54, 0.3);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;  /* align children to the left */
    justify-content: flex-start;
    text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.rules-square h2, .rules-square h3 {
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}


.rules-square ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
}

.rules-square li, .rules-square p {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.rules-square li::before {
    content: attr(data-suit) " "; 
    font-weight: bold;
}

.spade::before { color: black; }
.club::before { color: black; }
.heart::before { color: red; }
.diamond::before { color: red; }
</style>
